\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 3. Associated paper\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 I found 
\f0\b no dedicated paper, preprint, thesis, or data descriptor for the MET dataset itself
\f1\b0  in the available results. The OpenNeuro page\'92s reference is a BIDS-methods citation, not a paper describing MET:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Pernet, C. R., Appelhoff, S., Gorgolewski, K. J., Flandin, G., Phillips, C., Delorme, A., Oostenveld, R. (2019). 
\f3\i Scientific Data, 6
\f1\i0 , 103. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-019-0104-8"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-019-0104-8}}[{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://openneuro.org/datasets/ds008701/versions/1.0.5"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 openneuro}}]\
